digraph account_payable_process_148 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "create voucher for the documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"create voucher for the documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the vendor accounting department. 
When sending to the vendor accounting department is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
Once creating a receiving report occurs, gathering the vendors invoice needs to be done. 
Once gathering the vendors invoice occurs, you need to create voucher for the documents.
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process and starts with receipt to the vendor accounting department.
When a submittal is completed to the vendor accounting department, you need to create a receiving report.
Once a receiving report appears, the gather the vendor's invoice needs to be done.
Once the vendor bill comes to a conclusion, you need to create a voucher for the documents.
The process is now finished.
"
}
